# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Not a style preference. AMO requires the source of an add-on that uses a build
# step to rebuild into the package that was uploaded, and a reviewer on Linux
# checking out a repository full of CRLF gets different bytes to a build made on
# Windows. The files then differ by nothing anyone can see, which is the worst
# way to fail that check.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.xpi binary
